168	            // HandleCors middleware adds these during normal flow, but when
169	            // an exception propagates past it the rendered response skips
170	            // the CORS header injection. Laravel Cloud's proxy also strips
171	            // CORS headers on some error responses. This guard ensures the
172	            // browser can always read the error body.
173	            if ($response !== null
